[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/wenhan-client/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/wenhan-client/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Wenhan Client[/h1]Wenhan Client is a collection of independent features designed to make Minecraft easier to control, explore, build, and customize.
[h2]Features[/h2][h3]General[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Password Hiding Mode[/td]
[td]For supported login and account commands, disable masking, hide password contents with a matching number of asterisks, or also hide password length with a fixed eight-character mask.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Hide Realms[/td]
[td]Disables Realms background checks and hides the Minecraft Realms button on the title screen.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Instant Respawn[/td]
[td]Skips the death screen and respawns immediately.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Block Explosion Guard[/td]
[td]Prevents using beds or straw beds outside the Overworld, and respawn anchors outside the Nether. Mining is not blocked.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Safe Drop[/td]
[td]Requires a second drop key press to confirm dropping protected items in game.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Camera Collision[/td]
[td]Keeps the third-person camera distance fixed instead of shortening it when blocks are behind you.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Attack Through Blocks[/td]
[td]Off: no block penetration. Attack Through Foliage: target through blocks without collision, such as grass and flowers. Attack Through All Blocks: ignore all blocks and prioritize living entities along the view ray within attack reach, keeping the normal hit when none is found.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Fog[/td]
[td]Removes water, lava, powdered snow, blindness, darkness, weather, boss, dimension terrain fog, the void sky mask, low-altitude sky darkening, biome sky tints, sky color changes in fluids, and FOV distortion.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Always Render Barriers[/td]
[td]Keeps barrier, structure void, and light blocks visible.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Mining Delay[/td]
[td]While holding attack on blocks, lowers repeat mining delay to 1 tick.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Item Use Delay[/td]
[td]While holding use on blocks, lowers repeat use/place delay to 1 tick.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Stable Mining[/td]
[td]While mining a block, keeps your crosshair aimed at that block's center unless the line of sight is blocked.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Scaffold Placement Assist[/td]
[td]While holding a block and not targeting a real block, allows the crosshair to target placeable cells one block horizontally outward from blocks with a selectable outline. Fluids are not expansion anchors, and real block hits always take priority.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Liquid Surface Placement[/td]
[td]While holding a block and not targeting a real block: when inside the matching liquid, targets liquid cells touching air; otherwise, targets air cells touching that liquid. This only supplies extra crosshair targets and never blocks placement allowed by other behavior.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Continuous Placement Constraint[/td]
[td]While the use key is held, subsequent placements are constrained relative to the first successfully placed block. Axial Line uses the second block to select the X, Y, or Z axis; Horizontal Plane fixes the Y coordinate; Vertical Plane uses the first horizontal offset to select a fixed-X or fixed-Z plane. The crosshair only targets placeable positions intersected by the view ray, including air blocks. Releasing the use key resets the placement sequence.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Player Highlight Mode[/td]
[td]Controls when player highlighting is active.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Player and Waypoint Information HUD[/td]
[td]Shows nearby player and waypoint information on the HUD.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
Player highlighting supports Disabled, Only While Holding Tab, and Always Enabled modes. The HUD can show names, relative directions, horizontal distances, health, and coordinates.
Example:
[code]Player867 ↑ 11m ❤ 20.0 (123, 64, -456)[/code]
[h3]Movement[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Creative Flying[/td]
[td]Enables flight in Survival and Adventure mode.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Disable Creative Flight[/td]
[td]Prevents creative flight from starting and stops active creative flight.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Disable Elytra Flight[/td]
[td]Prevents elytra flight from starting and stops active elytra gliding.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Flight Reset[/td]
[td]Keeps creative flight enabled when touching the ground.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Freecam Interaction Rotation[/td]
[td]Turns the local player toward interaction targets when using Freecam interactions. Optionally restores the original view afterward.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Wall Climb[/td]
[td]Lets only the local player climb walls of any block. Hold jump next to a wall or move against it to climb upward.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Elytra Cancel[/td]
[td]Press jump while elytra gliding to stop fall flying.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Jump Delay[/td]
[td]Removes the jump cooldown so holding jump can trigger consecutive jumps immediately.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Levitation[/td]
[td]Cancels levitation for the local player.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Slow Falling[/td]
[td]Cancels slow falling for the local player.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Collision[/td]
[td]Prevents other entities from pushing the local player.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Fluid Platform[/td]
[td]Allows the local player to stand on water and lava surfaces. Sneak to pass through.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Solid Cobweb[/td]
[td]Gives cobwebs a full-block collision box only for the local player without affecting Attack Through Blocks.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Void Floor[/td]
[td]Creates a one-way floor at Y=-105 in the Overworld and Y=-41 in the Nether and End. Requires flight permission and only blocks downward movement.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Slowdown[/td]
[td]Removes movement slowdown while using shields, bows, crossbows, tridents, spyglasses, goat horns, food, and drink items, and removes the horizontal speed limit while climbing.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Slime Bounce[/td]
[td]Prevents slime blocks from bouncing the local player.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Follow Minecart Direction[/td]
[td]When the current minecart turns, applies the same change to the player view.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Air Step Up[/td]
[td]Allows player step-up handling while airborne when colliding with small ledges.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Step Down[/td]
[td]Allows smooth controlled step-down when moving toward reachable lower ground.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Step Height[/td]
[td]Sets the step height.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Sneaking Step Height[/td]
[td]Sets the step height used while sneaking.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Override Jump Height[/td]
[td]Overrides the local player's jump strength using the configured target jump height.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Target Jump Height[/td]
[td]Saved target jump height in blocks. The jump strength is calculated at runtime from this height and the player's gravity.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Infinite Jumps[/td]
[td]Allows unlimited jumps while airborne.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Jump Count[/td]
[td]Sets the total number of jumps available before landing. Set to 1 to disable extra jumps.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Double Jump Cooldown[/td]
[td]Requires the configured number of ticks between additional airborne jumps.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Double Jump Cooldown Ticks[/td]
[td]Sets the number of ticks required between additional airborne jumps. Minimum: 0.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Coyote Time[/td]
[td]Allows a ground jump for this many ticks after walking or falling off an edge. Minimum: 0.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Delayed Falling Time[/td]
[td]After walking off a block edge, keeps the player at the same height for this many ticks.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Auto Greet[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Greet on Your Join[/td]
[td]Sends your configured messages in order after you join a server.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Greet Other Players[/td]
[td]Greets joining players according to the blacklist and whitelist rules.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
Messages can use [b]@player[/b], [b]@UUID[/b], [b]@X[/b], [b]@Y[/b], [b]@Z[/b], [b]@health[/b], and [b]@level[/b] placeholders.
[h3]Auto Login[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enable Auto Login[/td]
[td]Logs in with the saved password after joining this server. A password must first be saved for this server.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Set or Change Password[/td]
[td]Enter a new password and save. The password is never populated when this screen opens; leaving it blank keeps the saved password. The field is cleared after saving.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Clear Saved Password[/td]
[td]Immediately deletes the locally saved password for this server. This button is unavailable when no password is saved.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Delete This Server's Login Settings[/td]
[td]Immediately removes this server entry, its saved password, and its enabled state.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
Passwords are encrypted on the device and are not displayed again after saving.
[h3]Who I Am[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Show Own Name Tag[/td]
[td]Shows your own player name tag in third-person or free-camera views.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Name in Window Title[/td]
[td]Adds your player name to the Minecraft window title.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]No Texture Rotation[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enabled[/td]
[td]Disables position-based random block model variants such as random texture rotation.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Disable Random Offset[/td]
[td]Removes random visual position offsets from blocks such as grass and bamboo.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Keep Collision Offsets[/td]
[td]Keeps visual offsets for blocks with a non-empty collision shape.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Fly Speed Modifier[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enabled[/td]
[td]Enables flight speed multiplier adjustment.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Maximum Speed[/td]
[td]Saved upper bound for the temporary flight speed multiplier. Minimum: 1.00x. Recommended: 100.00x or lower.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Minimum Speed[/td]
[td]Lower bound for the temporary flight speed multiplier. Supported range: 0.00x to 1.00x.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Default Speed[/td]
[td]Saved multiplier used for the first adjustment and for reset-on-adjust. Minimum: the configured minimum speed. Maximum: the configured maximum speed.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Reset Before Adjustment[/td]
[td]When enabled, pressing the adjustment key resets the multiplier to the configured default value. When disabled, the previous multiplier is preserved.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Multiplier Step[/td]
[td]Controls how many non-linear multiplier adjustment operations are applied per mouse-wheel unit.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Apply to Other Movement[/td]
[td]Also applies the current multiplier to client-controlled movement.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Boat Utils[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Unlock View Rotation[/td]
[td]Removes the vanilla 180-degree yaw restriction, allowing the camera to rotate freely in a full circle.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Follow View[/td]
[td]Makes the boat follow the view direction. Left and right movement keys strafe horizontally instead of turning the boat.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Auto Recenter Camera[/td]
[td]When Follow View is disabled, smoothly recenters the camera after 1.5 seconds without mouse camera movement.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Direction Hotkeys[/td]
[td]Enables the four boat direction shortcuts. Up snaps to the nearest allowed direction, Down turns around, and Left or Right turns to the next allowed direction on that side.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Diagonal Directions[/td]
[td]When enabled, allowed directions are every multiple of 45 degrees. When disabled, only the four cardinal directions are allowed.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Increase Boat Speed[/td]
[td]Makes the boat use blue ice friction at all times.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Prevent Sinking[/td]
[td]While the boat is underwater, sets an upward speed to prevent it from sinking.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Boat Step Height[/td]
[td]Sets the maximum height the boat can step up while moving. Range: 0.0 to 10.0 blocks.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enable Handbrake[/td]
[td]While controlling a boat, holding the jump key applies the handbrake.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enable Release Boost[/td]
[td]If enabled, after releasing the handbrake, adds a boost based on how long the handbrake was held.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Enable Lateral Friction[/td]
[td]Applies additional friction to lateral boat movement.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Entity Highlighter[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Entity Groups[/td]
[td]Configures highlighting for attackable entities, dropped items, animals, monsters, or all entities. Specific entity rules take priority over standard group rules.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Entity Types[/td]
[td]Configures highlighting and color for individual entity types. Dropped items are handled by Item Highlight.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Auto Aim[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Auto Aim Mode[/td]
[td]Controls when a target is locked. A target is released after leaving the current entity interaction range.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Restore View After Aiming[/td]
[td]Records the view before auto aim begins and restores it under the selected condition when the target is lost or the lock ends.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Maximum Auto-Attack Distance[/td]
[td]Auto aim only locks creatures within this distance. The effective range is also limited by the current main-hand item's attack range. Distance is measured from the player's viewpoint to the nearest point of the target's hitbox.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Highlight Target[/td]
[td]Shows a glowing outline around the currently locked auto-aim target.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Target Highlight Color[/td]
[td]Sets the glowing outline color for the locked auto-aim target.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Automatic Attack[/td]
[td]After Cooldown waits for full attack charge and then adds the delay. Enabled only applies the configured delay. The delay also applies to newly selected targets.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Automatic Attack Delay[/td]
[td]Ticks to wait before an automatic attack, including the first selection and target switches.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h3]Client Pseudo Unrestrict[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Block Interaction Range Limit[/td]
[td]Extends the local client's block interaction range. Servers may still reject distant interactions.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]No Entity Interaction Range Limit[/td]
[td]Extends the local client's entity interaction range. Servers may still reject distant interactions.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Instant Break[/td]
[td]Makes the local client calculate block breaking as instant. Servers may still correct the result.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
Multiplayer servers may still reject or correct actions that are not permitted by their rules.
[h3]Other Features[/h3][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Feature[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Forward Lock[/td]
[td]Double-tap forward while holding sprint to keep moving[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Find[/td]
[td]Finds loaded mobs or blocks by ID[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Ghostblock[/td]
[td]Adds client-side ghost items for testing[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Best Armor[/td]
[td]Adds prepared equipment boxes to the operator creative inventory[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Map Locator[/td]
[td]Turns markers from a held map into tracked waypoints[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Numeric Enchantment Levels[/td]
[td]Shows enchantment levels as numbers[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Boat Item Visibility[/td]
[td]Keeps held items visible while controlling a boat[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Remove Command Length Limit[/td]
[td]Allows longer text in the command input box[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Leave Button[/td]
[td]Leaves the current world with one key[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Default Controls[/h2][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Control[/th]
[th]Action[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]V[/td]
[td]Toggle Creative Flying[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]B[/td]
[td]Toggle Flight Disablers[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Left Alt + Mouse Wheel[/td]
[td]Adjust flight speed[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]I[/td]
[td]Toggle Player Highlighter keep mode[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]TAB[/td]
[td]Hold to highlight players[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]F8[/td]
[td]Toggle password hiding[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Grave Accent (`)[/td]
[td]Leave the current world[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td]Arrow Keys[/td]
[td]Control boat direction shortcuts when enabled[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Commands[/h2][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Command[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/wc autologin login[/b][/td]
[td]Tries the saved login for the current server[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/wc findmob[/b][/td]
[td]Finds loaded entities of the selected type[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/wc findblock[/b][/td]
[td]Finds loaded blocks of the selected type[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/get[/b][/td]
[td]Adds a ghost item[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/i[/b][/td]
[td]Shows the current player identity[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.3[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.5+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.160.5+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Mod Menu (Optional)[/*]
[*]YetAnotherConfigLib (Optional)[/*]
[*]Do a Barrel Roll (Optional)[/*]
[*]Freecam (Optional)[/*]
